  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "30-pin ESP32 devkit (DOIT DevKit v1 / Elegoo) on 2x 1x15 female sockets, 2.54mm pitch, 24.5mm between rows. Pad 1 = EN (module/antenna end). Left col pads 1-15 = EN,VP,VN,D34,D35,D32,D33,D25,D26,D27,D14,D12,D13,GND,VIN. Right col pads 16-30 = D23,D22,TX0,RX0,D21,D19,D18,D5,TX2,RX2,D4,D2,D15,GND,3V3. Devkit's own USB-C ends up at the VIN/3V3 end. Verified against user's board photo 2026-08-30.")
  (tags "ESP32 devkit socket module")

